<listApp>
<app>
<note>Text based on CIL 10 07489. The inscription is lost: Gualtherus was the last editor to observe it.</note>
</app>
<app loc="line 1">
    <note>The letter R is found in the word Masurto in Gualtherus' drawing and edited to E by Mommsen. The integration of the letter N to form the name Mansueto is found in H.G. Pflaum, Les carrières procuratoriennes équestres sous le Haut-Empire romain, vol. 1, Paris, 1960 p. 1018 and Diz. Ep., vol. IV, pars III, Roma 1964, s.v. Lipara, p. 1409</note>
</app>
</listApp>
